WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Check scope and month window
Choose up to twelve cohort months for this store. Registration origin,
store relationships and paid purchases describe separate events; do not
add their counts together.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Separate complete, partial and future months
Read September's complete October rate, November's partial count and
future months marked unobserved. These synthetic figures illustrate
repeat buyers, not revenue.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Read the gaps before drawing conclusions
Investigate missing historical identity, timing and funding evidence
before comparing months. Test purchases are excluded; zero retained
observations does not prove no historic customers.
